  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in children aged under 5 years without active TB: DST AI vs TST 5mm 76.57% (Dovgalyuk 2012) and C-Tb vs TST 15mm 88.51% (Aggerbeck 2018). The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 81.97% (71.38–89.23) across 484 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST لدى الأطفال دون سن الخامسة غير المصابين بالسل النشط: DST AI مقابل TST 5 مم 76.57% (Dovgalyuk 2012)، وC-Tb مقابل TST 15 مم 88.51% (Aggerbeck 2018). ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 81.97% (71.38–89.23) لدى 484 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
